			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add Mist WebSocket transport and eager runtime initialization\n\nIntroduce direct Sky-to-Cocoon WebSocket transport (B7-S6) eliminating the Mountain gRPC hop for ~95% of extension-API IPC volume. The new MistWebSocketTransport handles authentication via subprotocol/query param, exponential backoff reconnection (100ms-5s, dead after 30s), and request/response correlation.\n\nKey changes:\n- LandWorkbenchRuntime: Switch from lazy to eager ManagedRuntime initialization via IIFE at module load, removing first-call latency and ensuring single runtime instance across Sky chunks.\n- FileSystemProviderImplementation: Replace Effect.runPromise(IPCService.invoke) with direct @tauri-apps/api/core invoke for MountainIPCInvoke.\n- MistWebSocketTransport (new): Full WebSocket client with pending request map, health checks, and notify/invoke APIs.\n- TauriMainProcessService: Add WebSocket routing tier checked before Node tier; InitializeWebSocket() entry point for Sky bootstrap.\n\nImpact: Reduced IPC latency for extension host communication, simpler Tauri invoke path, and foundation for Mountain gRPC offload.",
			"SHA": "27003f66c45b115f6a6c3ecfa4d6a19dad5277a5"
